ription":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":7,"created_at":"2025-02-13T08:05:45Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T18:05:30Z","closed_at":"2025-12-08T18:01:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.3-stable, 4.4-beta3\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable - Windows 10.0.22631 - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6614) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-12900H (20 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nNormally, both MeshInstance3Ds and MMIs cull based on comparing the AABB of the visible meshes with the visibility_ranges. \n\nThis means, even if the MMI instance transforms are far from the location of the MMI node, they are still culled based upon distance to the center of the AABBs encompassing the instances. The MMI location is ignored.\n\nHowever, if `visibility_range_fade_mode = self`, this is not true. Shadows correctly cull based on the AABB. The visual mesh is incorrectly culled by something else, so the shadows show but the mesh does not.\n\nThis is preventing us from providing fading between instance LODs in Terrain3D.\n\nMMI location in the center of the instances AABB\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2ea612ae-8666-40c8-bc86-33f4792d2b74)\n\nMMI location far from the instances AABB\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f09a11ff-f5e7-44da-a2a2-b22b165ab6ac)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen the MRP. Look at TestArea3. Move the camera towards the center of the grey areas. Read the README node for more info.  \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test-mmi-margin.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18780067/test-mmi-margin.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https:/